BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 609.0 Tm (and internally contradictory geometry rather than assume a familiar floppy layout.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 580.0 Tm (Each FAT12 entry is twelve bits. Consecutive entries are packed across byte boundaries; the) Tj ET
