BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 592.0 Tm (indicators.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 563.0 Tm (The FAT12 root directory occupies a fixed region after the FAT copies; it is not a normal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 546.0 Tm (cluster chain. Subdirectories occupy clusters and contain entries including dot and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 529.0 Tm (dot-dot. Classic directory records are 32 bytes, with 8.3 names, attributes, timestamps,) Tj ET
