BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 677.0 Tm (FAT12 has no original journal, no block checksums and no native copy-on-write transactions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 660.0 Tm (Formatting traditionally creates FAT copies, but duplicated tables are not an atomic commit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 643.0 Tm (protocol. The dirty/clean state conventions and DOS/OS utility behaviours vary by version.) Tj ET
