BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 609.0 Tm (entries with an invalid parent directory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 580.0 Tm (The correct identification sequence is: validate BPB fields, compute the data-sector area,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 563.0 Tm (calculate the number of data clusters, verify it is below 4085, then parse packed 12-bit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 546.0 Tm (entries and enforce the chosen geometry. Blindly trusting a FAT12 string label or treating) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 529.0 Tm (a FAT16 volume as a small FAT12 volume can corrupt data. Unmounted disposable test images) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 512.0 Tm (are required for writes, formatting and repair.) Tj ET
